    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>WooCommerce grouped products do not show the grouped product title in the cart or checkout by default.</p>\n<p>This plugin fixes that.</p>\n<p>When a customer adds a child product from a grouped product page, the grouped product name will be shown above the item in:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Cart page  </li>\n<li>Checkout page  </li>\n<li>Mini cart  </li>\n<li>Order emails  </li>\n</ul>\n<p>Useful for:<br />\n&#8211; Class bookings<br />\n&#8211; Workshops<br />\n&#8211; Event sessions<br />\n&#8211; Course packages<br />\n&#8211; Location-based grouped products</p>\n<p>Lightweight, no settings required.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload plugin folder to <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code></li>\n<li>Activate the plugin</li>\n<li>Done</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"does%20this%20slow%20down%20woocommerce%3F\">\nDoes this slow down WooCommerce?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>No. It only runs on grouped product pages and cart display.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"does%20it%20work%20with%20all%20themes%3F\">\nDoes it work with all themes?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. It uses core WooCommerce hooks.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<p>Initial release.</p>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Displays the grouped product name before child items in WooCommerce cart and checkout.",
    "description": "<p>WooCommerce grouped products do not show the grouped product title in the cart or checkout by default.</p>\n<p>This plugin fixes that.</p>\n<p>When a customer adds a child product from a grouped product page, the grouped product name will be shown above the item in:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Cart page  </li>\n<li>Checkout page  </li>\n<li>Mini cart  </li>\n<li>Order emails  </li>\n</ul>\n<p>Useful for:<br />\n&#8211; Class bookings<br />\n&#8211; Workshops<br />\n&#8211; Event sessions<br />\n&#8211; Course packages<br />\n&#8211; Location-based grouped products</p>\n<p>Lightweight, no settings required.</p>\n",
